    "Description": {
        "Cost": 13520000,
        "Details": "The Blackjack's version 2 battlemechs are rock-solid and serious mainstay patrol and combat battlemechs, supporting many Predator autocannons at a time along with a number of Viper-2 short-range rockets, and some machineguns as an extra touch of sweet hot lethality.  With beefed-up armor and support for up to a tough 59 tons, this variant means serious business for a medium class battlemech, and is top-tier for such.  It also has reinforced and redesigned internal structure, that can take more of a beating.  However, unlike the version 1, this variant doesn't support any energy weapons, unless you like small lasers or something for support weapons you put on it.",
